# PredictEdge

An industrial predictive maintenance system combining embedded firmware, electrical hardware, backend database integration, and AI-powered workflow automation.

## Team & Roles

- **Mohamed Waleed** — Electrical Engineering & Hardware Design
- **Mohamed Mostafa** — AI Automation & Workflow Integration
- **Youssef Mohamed** — Backend & Database Architecture
- **Marwan Mohamed** — Embedded Software & Firmware Implementation

---

### Project Structure Note (`include/`)
This directory contains `.h` header files for shared C/C++ declarations and macro definitions included via `#include "header.h"` in `src/`, keeping definitions
centralized and avoiding duplication. For more details, see the [GCC Header Files Documentation](https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/cpp/Header-Files.html).
